# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Game Title Researcher — Environment Variables
# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# ALL sources work WITHOUT any API keys.
# Keys below are OPTIONAL and enable richer data sources.
#
# Copy this file to .env and fill in values as needed.
# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Steam Web API (enables IStoreQueryService for richer search)
# Get from: https://steamcommunity.com/dev/apikey
# STEAM_API_KEY=

# IGDB / Twitch (enables IGDB database — richest game catalog)
# Get from: https://dev.twitch.tv/ → Applications
# IGDB_CLIENT_ID=
# IGDB_CLIENT_SECRET=

# Giant Bomb (enables historical game verification)
# Get from: https://www.giantbomb.com/api/
# GIANTBOMB_API_KEY=
